# This directory ships as-is to sergio0p.github.io/seating/ — everything
# committed here is public and downloadable.  Keep out what is neither part of
# the page nor worth publishing.
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The access-code table: 52 working credentials.  The one genuinely secret file
# in this project — committing it would publish every student's link.  See
# PHASE2-PLAN.md.
data/codes-local.json
data/codes-*.json

# Photos of the real lecture hall: 24 MB of source material the page never
# loads, and publishing pictures of the room is not the point of the app.
# They stay local (Dropbox has them); their README is committed so the record
# of what they settled survives.
data/room-photos/*.heic
data/room-photos/*.jpg
data/room-photos/*.jpeg
data/room-photos/*.mov
